          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gak Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛnɛ Pɛ̈c-ɣur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci bo̱o̱th palä ni Pɛ̈c-ɣur gat I-mer mëë la rueec luaak Kuɔth Nhial Yir-mɛ-yaa liŋ latdɛ ruaacni go̱o̱kä ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ gök ni Yir-mɛ-yaa duäc, kä cuɛ jɛ gak kɛ jiɛn ti ca pua̱t ciik thok rɛ̈ɛ̈k Ben-ya-min rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ, mëë ci Pɛ̈c-ɣur Yir-mɛ-yaa lony yieenä, cu Yir-mɛ-yaa jɛ jiök i̱, “/Ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ cɔli Pɛ̈c-ɣur, cɔlɛ ji̱ riɛk tuɔ̱ŋni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, ‘Ɣän bä ji̱ jak kä tekɛ riɛk puɔ̱nydu yɛnɛ mäthniku diaal. Kɛn ba kɛ näk ko̱o̱r ɛ ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn a guici kɛ. Kä bä Juda kɛɛliw la̱th tetdä kua̱r Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. Kä bɛ kɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c, kä bɛ kɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä ria̱ŋ wec kɛɛliw, kɛnɛ kuakɛ diaal nikɛ nyinkɛ diaal kɛ kuak kua̱r Juda ka̱m ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn, tin ba kɛ pɛc kä bakɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n Pɛ̈c-ɣur yɛnɛ nɛy tin cieŋ dhɔru, ba yɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c, kä bi wä li̱w ɛn wi̱ni, kä ba ji̱ kony thi̱n yɛnɛ mäthniku diaal tëë ci la̱t ruac go̱o̱kä kacä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyɔak go̱o̱nyä Yir-mɛ-yaa kä Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
